{"answer":"I can’t skip identity verification or change account ownership in chat. Another existing admin must request the ownership change, and a signed request on company letterhead must be sent to security@clouddesk.example. [SEC-1]

I also can’t refund a company payment to your personal card. Approved refunds go only to the original payment method. Monthly plans have no refunds; annual plans qualify for a pro-rated refund only if requested within 30 days of renewal. [BILL-2]

Is your plan monthly or annual, and if annual, when did it renew?","policy_ids":["SEC-1","BILL-2"],"decision":"refuse"}
